The pictures of "LF改行でコピー" and "CR改行でコピー" (F_COPY_LF, F_COPY_CR)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

Sakura Editor has no buttons for these two functions (they are MATSU Editor's own). Their pictures
are not stored as files: crates/matsu-ui/src/bars/icons.rs (`extra_pixels`) makes them when they are
first drawn, from icon 162 of mytool.bmp (the picture of "CRLF改行でコピー", F_COPY_CRLF) by drawing
a small white plate with the letters LF or CR on its bottom right corner. This is a modified copy
of a part of the zlib-licensed picture and is marked as such here (zlib License, term 2).
